       "\tpira & 0.0487 & 0.0081 & -0.1317\\\\\n",
       "\ttwoearn & 0.0399 & 0.0112 &  0.2589\\\\\n",
       "\\end{tabular}\n"
      ],
      "text/markdown": [
       "\n",
       "A matrix: 3 × 3 of type dbl\n",
       "\n",
       "| <!--/--> | gain.Y | gain.D | rho |\n",
       "|---|---|---|---|\n",
       "| inc | 0.1366 | 0.0502 | -0.3372 |\n",
       "| pira | 0.0487 | 0.0081 | -0.1317 |\n",
       "| twoearn | 0.0399 | 0.0112 |  0.2589 |\n",
       "\n"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "        gain.Y gain.D rho    \n",
       "inc     0.1366 0.0502 -0.3372\n",
       "pira    0.0487 0.0081 -0.1317\n",
       "twoearn 0.0399 0.0112  0.2589"
